  {
   "text": "Five Secrets of Strixhaven Commander decks were released together with Secrets of Strixhaven on April 24, 2026.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "Each deck introduces twelve new-to- Magic cards alongside 88 reprints.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each package contains :",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 ready-to-play deck of 100 Magic cards 12 new-to- Magic cards, including 2 traditional foil cards",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "10 double-sided tokens",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "Secrets of Strixhaven Commander has 5 new cycles of cards.",
   "scene": 3,
   "section": "Cycles"
  },
  {
